  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 20 / 5 + 10 - 4 × 2 = 38\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) / and -\n\n20 / 5 + 10 - 4 × 2 = 38 ⇒ 20 - 5 + 10 / 4 × 2 = 38\n\n⇒ 20 - 5 + __**10 / 4**__ × 2 = 38\n\n⇒ 20 - 5 + __**2.5 × 2**__ = 38\n\n⇒ __**20 + 5**__ - 5 = 38\n\n⇒ __**25 - 5**__ = 38\n\n⇒ 20 ≠ 38 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) + and ×\n\n20 / 5 + 10 - 4 × 2 = 38 ⇒ 20 / 5 × 10 - 4 + 2 = 38\n\n⇒ __**20 / 5**__ × 10 - 4 + 2 = 38\n\n⇒ __**4 ×**____** 10**__ - 4 + 2 = 38\n\n⇒ __**40 + 2**__ - 4 = 38\n\n⇒ __**42**____** - 4**__ = 38\n\n⇒ **38 = 38 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3) × and /\n\n20 / 5 + 10 - 4 × 2 = 38 ⇒ 20 × 5 + 10 - 4 / 2 = 38\n\n⇒ 20 × 5 + 10 - __**4 / 2**__ = 38\n\n⇒ __**20 **____**×**____** 5**__ + 10 - 2 = 38\n\n⇒ __**100**____** + 10**__ - 2 = 38\n\n⇒ __**1**____**10 - 2**__ = 38\n\n⇒ 108 ≠ 38 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) - and ×\n\n20 / 5 + 10 - 4 × 2 = 38 ⇒ 20 / 5 + 10 × 4 - 2 = 38\n\n⇒ __**20 / 5**__ + 10 × 4 - 2 = 38\n\n⇒ 4 + __**10 **____**×**____** 4**__ - 2 = 38\n\n⇒ __**4 + 40**__ - 2 = 38\n\n⇒ __**4**____**4 - 2**__ = 38\n\n⇒ 42 ≠ 38 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
